  m_Name: Purify
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlayerSpells
  spellName: Purify Spell
  keyword: Puritas
  description: 'Spell Name: Purify


    Incantation Word: Puritas


    "The forests
    never asked for vengeance, only to be cleansed of what should never have touched
    them. Let the rivers run clear, let the roots breathe once more, and let the
    wounds carved into the earth slowly fade beneath the touch of renewal. For nature
    does not seek to destroy what corrupts it, only to reclaim what was always its
    own."'
